      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Get Started</h4>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/contact">Book a Discovery Call</a></li>
          <li><a href="/services">1-on-1 Coaching</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact Me</a></li>
